1090
00:46:23.180 --> 00:46:26.300
In the shooting draft, the scene read like this.
在拍摄剧本里，那场戏是这样写的。

1091
00:46:26.700 --> 00:46:29.420
Dwight, I don't want to waste your time.
德怀特，我不想浪费你的时间。

1092
00:46:29.660 --> 00:46:30.920
I wouldn't dare waste mine.
我也不敢浪费我的时间。

1093
00:46:31.160 --> 00:46:31.880
