She probably tweeted it, and this is when she sets up Wolf.
她可能发推特说了，这正是她准备搞“Wolf”的时候。

1268
00:54:26.220 --> 00:54:26.560
Yeah.
没错。

1269
00:54:26.560 --> 00:54:32.140
Yeah, she said she spends the whole day talking, video, chat, Skype, text, Twitter, phone, Wolf.
对，她说她整天都在聊天、视频、通话、Skype、发短信、推特、打电话，还有搞“Wolf”。

1270
00:54:32.520 --> 00:54:36.680
And then we go to Ryan's closet, and he's going to tell us what Wolf is.
然后镜头转到瑞安的壁橱，他要告诉我们“Wolf”是什么。

1271
00:54:36.860 --> 00:54:40.360
I will never get tired of seeing Ryan in that little closet.
看瑞安待在那个小壁橱里，我永远都不会腻。

1272
00:54:40.520 --> 00:54:40.940
I know.
我知道。

1273
00:54:41.880 --> 00:54:42.960
It's so true.
确实如此。

1274
00:54:43.460 --> 00:54:49.900
Ryan explains that Wolf is a site he's launching and hopes that it will be the last word in social
瑞安解释说“Wolf”是他正在推出的一个网站，希望它能成为社交网络的终极之作。

1275
00:54:49.900 --> 00:54:50.420
networking.
它基本上能连接你所有的通讯门户，他还做了一个演示。

