00:59:41.720 --> 00:59:45.420
I don't know which one is which, but when they walked in the door at the very beginning,
我分不清谁是谁，但当它们刚进门的时候，

1378
00:59:45.600 --> 00:59:46.800
I thought, same Danes.
我就想，还是那两只大丹犬。

1379
00:59:47.520 --> 00:59:48.400
Same Danes.
还是那两只。

1380
00:59:48.700 --> 00:59:54.640
Well, at the end of this meeting, Joe is going to invite Michael to leave with her.
好吧，在会议结束时，乔邀请迈克尔跟她一起离开。

1381
