发调情邮件。

1544
01:04:40.080 --> 01:04:40.680
Phyllis!
菲利斯！

1545
01:04:41.200 --> 01:04:44.260
And then he says to Pam
然后他对帕姆说，

1546
01:04:44.260 --> 01:04:46.100
while pointing to Phyllis,
同时指着菲利斯，

1547
01:04:46.100 --> 01:04:48.200
she thinks your kid is ugly.
她觉得你的孩子很丑。

1548
01:04:49.160 --> 01:04:50.660
Then he says to Jim
然后他对吉姆说，

1549
01:04:50.660 --> 01:04:51.780
while pointing to Pam,
同时指着帕姆，

1550
01:04:52.000 --> 01:04:53.360
she hates that you can't
她讨厌你无法

1551
01:04:53.360 --> 01:04:54.180
put up a hammock
挂个吊床

1552
01:04:54.180 --> 01:04:55.300
without a handyman.
不用找修理工。

1553
01:04:55.540 --> 01:04:56.540
A hammock?
吊床？

1554
01:04:57.020 --> 01:04:58.020
A hammock?
吊床？

1555
01:04:58.660 --> 01:05:00.660
My God, Lee gives me trouble
天哪，李总是找我麻烦

1556
