说吊床这个词的时候。

1557
01:05:02.060 --> 01:05:04.740
It has a freaking O in it, everybody.
大家听着，它里面明明有个O。

1558
01:05:05.220 --> 01:05:05.780
Hammock!
吊床！

1559
01:05:06.240 --> 01:05:07.900
How does everybody say it?
大家到底是怎么说的？

1560
01:05:07.980 --> 01:05:10.220
If you're on vacation with Jenna,
如果你和珍娜去度假，

1561
01:05:10.380 --> 01:05:11.820
you might go lay in a hammock.
你可能会去躺在吊床上。

1562
01:05:11.960 --> 01:05:12.700
It's hammock.
是吊床。

1563
01:05:12.780 --> 01:05:13.500
You know it's hammock.
你知道是吊床。

1564
01:05:13.640 --> 01:05:14.060
No!
不对！

1565
01:05:14.580 --> 01:05:15.240
Come on.
拜托。

1566
01:05:15.240 --> 01:05:16.300
You gotta let this one go.
你得放下这件事了。

1567
01:05:16.460 --> 01:05:17.280
No, guys!
不，伙计们！

1568
01:05:17.460 --> 01:05:17.700
Come on!
拜托！

1569
01:05:17.700 --> 01:05:19.120
I can't believe I'm saying
我真不敢相信

1570
01:05:19.120 --> 01:05:20.340
something correctly.
我竟然说对了。

1571
01:05:22.340 --> 01:05:23.260
Here's the thing.
事情是这样的。

1572
01:05:23.400 --> 01:05:24.680
I bought a hammock
我买了个吊床

1573
01:05:24.680 --> 01:05:26.140
