把它挂上去。

1578
01:05:31.240 --> 01:05:32.020
And the whole time,
结果全程，

1579
01:05:32.180 --> 01:05:32.640
he was like,
他都在说，

1580
01:05:32.780 --> 01:05:33.260
Jenna,
珍娜，

1581
01:05:34.000 --> 01:05:34.480
hammock.
吊床。

1582
01:05:35.360 --> 01:05:36.920
It has an O in it.
它里面有个O。

1583
01:05:37.120 --> 01:05:39.480
H-O-M-M-O-C-K.
H-O-M-M-O-C-K。

1584
01:05:39.560 --> 01:05:40.720
There's a lot of words
英语里有很多单词

1585
